  "biobricks:reviewed": false,
  "biobricks:reviewNotes": "Determined by the BioBricks licensing-provenance annotator (Claude). The README states RTECS must be purchased from CCOHS and the download stage authenticates to the CCOHS FTP portal with a paid RTECS_USERNAME/RTECS_PASSWORD. RTECS is a proprietary, subscription-licensed commercial database (no open/Creative Commons license); redistribution is controlled by the CCOHS licence agreement. Classed restricted / prohibited: it may NOT be redistributed to a commercial licensee under the deployment contract without a separate CCOHS RTECS licence. Note: the enrichment metadata in .bb/brick.jsonld describes RTECS as 'maintained by NIOSH' - historically true, but distribution today is commercial via CCOHS; a human should confirm the exact CCOHS licence terms.",
